            "reviewBody": "This gelatin had great flavor....but I could not get the red layer to set up. I put most of it in a glass baking dish and some in glasses. The green set up just fine, but the red was still loose. It didn't take away from the flavor, just the presentation. I'm going to try it again to see what I did wrong. I",
